Package: com.ratush.catmcpcc
Name: CatMCP CC Toggle
Description: Control Center toggle for the CatMCP server on Dopamine rootless. The tile flips the `enabled` key in com.catmcp.server.plist and kickstarts com.ratush.catmcp-autoinjectd so the change applies immediately.
